      "cooked": "<p>Okay, so, y’all remember the roster of the old freedom four team, right? Greatest Legacy, Absolute Zero (original), The Shrieker, and... The Wraith?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>this confuses me. This was a war era team, right? There’s no way that the wraith, Maia Montgomery, could possibly be a member of this team. Then how. Who is this Wraith?&nbsp;</p>",
