      "created_at": "2018-06-06T12:41:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This team would have been post WWII as Grandpa Legacy took part in that war and the Legacy on the original Freedom Four team is America’s Finest Legacy. &nbsp; It’s also been brought up in other episodes by Christopher and Adam how Wraith hasn’t aged much more than a few years but Legacy clearly has aged.</p>",
