      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/walkingtarget/{size}/4833_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-06-06T15:05:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What Powerhound said. The \"Death of Legacy\" story where Paul VII died was in <em>Justice Comics </em>#101 in September of '48 with Paul VIII taking over the Leagcy role the following month in issue #102. The Wraith's first appearance in <em>Mystery Comics</em> #27 coincided with that latter issue of <em>JC</em> (along with Haka's first appearance in <em>Arcane Tales</em> #14). The first issue of<em> </em>the <em>Freedom Four</em> book wasn't until May of 1950 (with the \"team-up\" aspect coming in in April '52 with <em>FF</em> #24).</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:51:12.419Z",
