      "raw": "<p>What Powerhound said. The &quot;Death of Legacy&quot; story where Paul VII died was in <em>Justice Comics </em>#101 in September of &#39;48 with Paul VIII taking over the Leagcy role the following month in issue #102. The Wraith&#39;s first appearance in <em>Mystery Comics</em> #27 coincided with that latter issue of <em>JC</em> (along with Haka&#39;s first appearance in <em>Arcane Tales</em> #14). The first issue of<em> </em>the <em>Freedom Four</em> book wasn&#39;t until May of 1950 (with the &quot;team-up&quot; aspect coming in in April &#39;52 with <em>FF</em> #24).</p>",
